invalid type: string "Policy EDR-02: Agent Check-In Frequency\nEDR agents must check in with the management console at least once every \n24 hours. Endpoints that miss two consecutive check-in windows must be \nflagged for investigation and, if unresponsive, isolated from the network.\n  - Telemetry Field Mapped: Last_CheckIn_Hours\n  - Golden Baseline Target: Last_CheckIn_Hours <= 24", expected f